\details{
The package implements one newly developed index and several adaptations
of existing selection indices for use with genotypic data. The indices are a newly Balanced selection index (BSI), an Adapted Smith selection index (SSI), an Adapted Mulamba & Mock selection index (MSI), and an Adapted Elston selection index (ESI). For more information about these indices see 'README' file.
